const options = this.project.getSourceExtraArgsCfg();
// For each source file, matches against glob patterns in the options...
// The matched args (containing -I, -D, etc.) are stored per-file
```

**The `-I` directives do NOT appear in `incDirs` of `builder.params`** -- they appear in the per-file `sourceParams` as extra compiler flags, and in `files.options.yml` under `virtualPathFiles` / `files` keys.

